{"id":1604,"name":"Koutetsu Tenshi Kurumi","slug":"koutetsu_tenshi_kurumi","synopsis":"During Japan's Taisho Era (1912-1926), a scientist named Ayanokoji developed the Steel Angel - an artificial humanoid with superhuman physical abilities. While the Imperial Army wanted to use the Steel Angel as a new means of modern warfare, Ayanokoji wanted his creation to be a new step in the future of mankind. Thus, he defied orders from the Army and secretly made the Steel Angel codenamed \"Kurumi\". Then one day, a young boy named Nakahito Kagura snuck into Ayanokoji's house as a dare by his friends and stumbled upon Kurumi's lifeless body. A sudden attack by the Imperial Army shook the house, causing Kurumi to fall on Nakahito. At that moment, their lips met, and Kurumi woke up from \"the kiss that started a miracle\".\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV_SHORT","season":"FALL","year":1999,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:07","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 04:29:32","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":554},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":554},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":511},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":88},{"site":"ANN","externalId":326},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":282}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":3199,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/SbjrdIEys65BAtKF4SxXCVBIMtysBrDGLvHB2RRs.jpg"},{"id":3200,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/iinueWDWYQyWoaZNPKdu3dIWpB5QSgqkxCxAbI0G.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":5,"name":"OLM","slug":"olm"},{"id":104,"name":"Production Reed","slug":"production_reed"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":92,"name":"Koutetsu Tenshi Kurumi","slug":"koutetsu_tenshi_kurumi"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":826,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":826,"title":"Kiss Kara Hajimaru Miracle","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":908,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":13203,"basename":"KoutetsuTenshiKurumi-OP1.webm","filename":"KoutetsuTenshiKurumi-OP1","link":"